 "query": "I swear I spent nearly an hour this morning chasing my tabby cat Mochi around the apartment after he swiped the fuzzy neon pink pom-pom off the end of my favorite knit scarf, darting under the couch, leaping over the stack of library books by the door, and even perching on top of the fridge for a solid ten minutes like he\u2019d won some kind of grand pet trophy. When I finally caught him, he dropped the slobbery, chewed-up pom-pom right in my palm and blinked at me like he\u2019d done me a huge favor bringing me a \u201cgift\u201d instead of destroying a winter accessory I\u2019ve had since college. I was still laughing about it as I made my second oat milk latte of the day, wiping a little coffee smudge off my sweatpants and realizing I\u2019d spent way more time on that silly cat chase than I\u2019d planned for my morning to-do list. Hey there, I\u2019m browsing your home office furniture sets section right now looking for a set that\u2019ll work great in my dining room, can you help me out? I\u2019m really hoping to find one that comes with that nice built-in cup holder feature I\u2019ve seen on some similar sets, I don\u2019t want to have to reach all the way to a side table for my coffee when I\u2019m working. I\u2019m only looking for options that are priced at a really good, fair rate, nothing that feels like a total ripoff for what you get. I don\u2019t have a super strict preference on the exact seat count as long as it fits the space I\u2019ve got, I\u2019m pretty flexible on that front as long as the other bits line up. Let me know what you\u2019ve got that matches what I\u2019m after!",
